      "widgets_values": [
        "[STAGE B — one angle or body view after identity approval]\nPreserve the same owner's approved identity and use matching real angle/body references. Produce ONE left three-quarter head-and-shoulders view, neutral expression, short haircut and rimless glasses, plain light-gray background, same clothing. Do not create a collage. Reject identity drift; never use a rejected or altered face as the next identity authority. For full-body output, first supply a real full-body reference; do not infer precise leg lengths from headshots."
