      "widgets_values": [
        "[STAGE C — one outfit, expression or scene change]\nPreserve the approved face, body proportions, short hair and rimless glasses. Change only the outfit to a simple contemporary navy overshirt over a plain white crew-neck T-shirt. Keep the existing pose, facial expression and neutral background. Natural texture, understated styling, no logos. One photo. Do not change the face to a fashion archetype."
      ]
